<mj-text>
  For example, with a gross salary of 2000&nbsp;€, 200&nbsp;€ a month goes into your II&nbsp;pillar: 94&nbsp;€ from your net salary and 106&nbsp;€ from taxes. The social tax part slightly reduces your I&nbsp;pillar.
  The last day to file the application is *|secondPillarRejoinDeadline|*. After rejoining you can no longer leave the II&nbsp;pillar.
</mj-text>
<mj-text><strong>Get the tax win again</strong></mj-text>
